5. Govern Node Blueprint Customization

Discussion Summary

Current State

- Standard model governance blueprints are currently in use.
- Recent governance efforts have focused on bundle and intake blueprints.

Future Customization Opportunities

Customized model blueprints can support:

- Interval-based sign-offs
- Scheduled leadership reviews
- Enhanced model drift oversight
- Cross-model visibility and alerting
- Team-specific governance maturity levels

Prerequisites

Before advanced governance capabilities can be fully leveraged:

- Model drift monitoring must be established.
- Automated retraining processes should be implemented.
- Scenario-based or scheduled retraining workflows should be operational.

