6. Intake Process Enhancements

Project Branching

Current Challenge

- Newer Dataiku versions require project duplication to create development branches.
- Users currently lack permissions to create projects independently.
- This prevents self-service branching.

Proposed Enhancement

Add a branching option to the intake process that allows users to request:

- Development branches
- Duplicate projects
- Project cloning workflows

This removes the dependency on project creation permissions.

Tutorial Project Creation

Current Challenge

- The existing intake process does not support tutorial project creation.

Proposed Enhancement

Add a tutorial project section to the intake form that:

- Presents available tutorial projects in a dropdown menu.
- Automatically provisions the selected tutorial project.

